{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Sell it to me.</b> With a chirik, like \"send the lad\" (Genesis 43:8), \"lie with me\" (Genesis 39:7). And the birthright, that he take a double portion in his father's wealth. And some say that the firstborn always has precedence over the younger, to rise before him and to serve him like a son to a father:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:50.119159336Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}